🧭 Masterplan: UX Design Assistant Platform
🎯 Product Vision
Build a professional, AI-enhanced UX toolkit where designers can conduct research, analyze accessibility, create personas, and generate user stories in one place — all through a modular, elegant, and future-ready interface.

🎨 Design Language (Airbnb/QuintoAndar Inspired)
Minimalist, clean interface with spacious layout and strong typographic hierarchy

Neutral color palette with soft grays and UX-blue accent (customizable)

Desktop-first UI, mobile responsive down to 375px

Subtle shadows, elevation, and visual clarity

Typography: Inter or IBM Plex Sans

Icons: Lucide or Heroicons

Light/dark mode toggle, WAI-ARIA structure, keyboard navigation

Breakpoints: 1280px, 1024px, 768px, 375px

🛠️ Tech Stack
Layer	Technology
Frontend	Next.js 14 (App Router)
Styling	TailwindCSS v4 with PostCSS
Backend	Supabase (Auth, DB, File Storage)
AI Layer	OpenAI GPT-4 Turbo
Accessibility	axe-core or WebAIM APIs
Hosting	Vercel
🧱 Architecture Principles
Modular dashboard with 5 independent tools (workspaces)

Each tool stores data per user (via Supabase schemas)

Role-based architecture for multi-user/team support

All AI-generated outputs are exportable (PDF, JSON, Markdown)

🧰 MVP Toolset (Workspaces)
UX Research Assistant — Analyze research data and generate summaries

Nielsen Heuristics Evaluator — Screenshot/URL analysis with usability reports

Persona Generator — Auto-generate detailed personas from questionnaire

Accessibility Checker — Scan for contrast, WCAG, semantic structure

Smart User Story Generator — Structured stories with alternate paths

